.TH RUSTBG 1
.SH NAME
rustbg \- static wallpapers for Wayland
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rustbg
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.I IMAGE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Displays an image on all connected outputs using the Wayland layer-shell protocol.
Images are scaled to fill the output and center-cropped.
FFmpeg decodes, scales and optionally blurs the image when loading, then exits.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-namespace " " NAME
Set the layer-shell namespace used by compositor rules.
The default is
.BR wallpaper .
.TP
.BI \-\-blur " SIGMA"
Apply Gaussian blur with a sigma of 0 to 1024 output pixels.
The default is 0, which disables blur.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help and exit.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Requires FFmpeg on PATH and a compositor supporting wlr-layer-shell.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on normal exit or when showing help, and 1 for invalid arguments or
startup failures.
